-- Catalogue reset, 2026-09-06. Generated from the Final Posters and the desktop label photographs.
-- Keeps the multivitamins, calcium, fish oil and collagen rows (their reviews and order history stay attached),
-- deactivates the rest of the old range, and adds the eight new formulas. Product images live in frontend/public/products/.
