values ('5e0c1f2a-0d4b-4c8e-9a1f-1d1c0a000002',$c$Calcitamin$c$,$c$CA-CAL-30$c$,$c$Bone Health$c$,$c$Calcium citrate with magnesium, zinc and vitamin D3 for strong bones and teeth.$c$,699,null,20,$c$/products/calcitamin.jpg$c$,'50% 50%',true,$c$Calcitamin is a complete bone and muscle formula for men and women. It combines calcium citrate, a well-absorbed form of calcium, with magnesium, zinc and vitamin D3, the nutrients the body needs to use that calcium well.
Calcium and vitamin D3 help maintain strong bones and teeth, magnesium supports normal muscle function, and zinc with vitamin D3 helps maintain a healthy immune system.

Uses
Bone Strength
Helps maintain healthy bones and normal bone density through adult life.
Healthy Teeth
Essential minerals support stronger teeth and oral wellness.
Muscle Function
Magnesium supports healthy muscle performance and flexibility.
Calcium Absorption
Vitamin D3 helps improve the uptake and utilisation of calcium in the body.
Daily Wellness
Complete nutritional support for everyday health and vitality.

Why calcium citrate?
Calcium citrate does not depend on stomach acid to dissolve, so it can be taken with or without food and is gentle on digestion. Paired with vitamin D3 for absorption and magnesium and zinc for bone metabolism, it gives the skeleton the full set of raw materials rather than calcium alone.$c$,$c$Bone strength • Teeth • Muscle function • Immunity$c$,$c$Nutrifort Energy • Nutriwoman Gestation$c$,$c$AM: Nutrifort Energy • PM: Calcitamin$c$,ARRAY[$c$Calcium citrate$c$,$c$30 tablets$c$,$c$Halal certified$c$,$c$GMP facility$c$]::text[],$c${"benefits": [{"icon": "bones", "title": "Supports Bone Strength", "text": "Calcium and vitamin D3 help maintain strong and healthy bones."}, {"icon": "general", "title": "Promotes Healthy Teeth", "text": "Essential minerals help support stronger teeth and oral wellness."}, {"icon": "absorption", "title": "Boosts Calcium Absorption", "text": "Vitamin D3 helps improve calcium utilisation in the body."}, {"icon": "muscle", "title": "Supports Muscle Function", "text": "Magnesium helps support healthy muscle performance and flexibility."}, {"icon": "immunity", "title": "Supports Immune Health", "text": "Zinc and vitamin D3 help maintain a healthy immune system."}, {"icon": "energy", "title": "Fatigue Support", "text": "Magnesium contributes to the reduction of tiredness and fatigue."}], "ingredients": [{"name": "Calcium Citrate", "amount": "", "purpose": "A well-absorbed form of calcium for the maintenance of normal bones and teeth, muscle function and nerve transmission."}, {"name": "Magnesium", "amount": "", "purpose": "Contributes to normal muscle function, energy metabolism and the maintenance of normal bones."}, {"name": "Zinc", "amount": "", "purpose": "Supports normal immune function and contributes to the maintenance of normal bones."}, {"name": "Vitamin D3 (Cholecalciferol)", "amount": "", "purpose": "Increases the absorption and utilisation of calcium and supports normal muscle and immune function."}], "howToUse": ["Take one tablet daily, preferably after a meal with water, or as directed by a healthcare professional.", "If you also take an iron supplement, leave a two-hour gap; calcium and iron compete for absorption.", "Pair with regular weight-bearing activity for the best effect on bone."], "faqs": [{"q": "Who is Calcitamin for?", "a": "Adult men and women who want to support bone and teeth strength, including anyone whose diet is low in dairy."}, {"q": "Can I take Calcitamin with a multivitamin?", "a": "Yes. It pairs well with Nutrifort Energy; take the calcium later in the day."}, {"q": "How long before I notice a difference?", "a": "Bone changes slowly. Use daily for at least three months alongside a balanced diet and activity."}, {"q": "How many tablets are in a pack?", "a": "30 tablets, a one-month supply at one tablet a day."}], "safetyInfo": "• Food supplement, not a substitute for a varied diet and a healthy lifestyle.\n• Consult a healthcare professional before use if pregnant, nursing, taking medication or under medical supervision.\n• Do not exceed the recommended dose.\n• Keep out of reach of children.\n• Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.\n• If you have kidney stones, a parathyroid condition or take heart medication, consult your doctor before use."}$c$::jsonb)
