values ('5e0c1f2a-0d4b-4c8e-9a1f-1d1c0a000003',$c$Cysterna$c$,$c$CA-CYS-30$c$,$c$Women’s Health$c$,$c$Ovulation support formula that nourishes and supports female reproductive health naturally.$c$,999,null,20,$c$/products/cysterna.jpg$c$,'50% 50%',true,$c$Cysterna is a scientifically formulated ovulation support supplement that nourishes, balances and supports reproductive health naturally.
It is designed for women planning a pregnancy or simply looking after their reproductive wellness: supporting healthy egg quality, healthy ovarian function and normal hormone balance as part of a healthy lifestyle.

Uses
Egg Quality
Helps support healthy egg development.
Ovarian Health
Helps maintain healthy ovarian function.
Female Fertility
Supports reproductive wellness naturally.
Hormonal Balance
Helps maintain healthy hormone levels through the cycle.
Reproductive Wellness
Supports overall reproductive health and everyday women's wellness.

A note on expectations
Cysterna is a food supplement, not a fertility treatment. It works best as part of a healthy routine, and anyone with a diagnosed condition or undergoing fertility care should use it under their doctor's guidance.$c$,$c$Fertility support • Hormonal balance • Women’s wellness$c$,$c$Nutriwoman Gestation • Ferrovix Fort$c$,$c$AM: Cysterna • PM: Ferrovix Fort$c$,ARRAY[$c$Ovulation support$c$,$c$30 tablets$c$,$c$GMP facility$c$,$c$WHO-GMP certified$c$]::text[],$c${"benefits": [{"icon": "general", "title": "Supports Egg Quality", "text": "Helps support healthy egg development."}, {"icon": "general", "title": "Supports Ovarian Health", "text": "Helps maintain healthy ovarian function."}, {"icon": "calm", "title": "Promotes Hormonal Balance", "text": "Helps maintain healthy hormone levels."}, {"icon": "heart", "title": "Supports Female Fertility", "text": "Supports reproductive wellness naturally."}, {"icon": "immunity", "title": "Women's Wellness", "text": "Supports female health and vitality every day."}], "ingredients": [], "howToUse": ["Take one tablet daily with a meal, or as directed by a healthcare professional.", "Use consistently across the cycle; the formula is designed for daily use, not single days.", "Tell your doctor you are taking it if you are under fertility care."], "faqs": [{"q": "Who should take Cysterna?", "a": "Adult women who want to support ovulation, hormone balance and reproductive wellness, including those planning a pregnancy."}, {"q": "Can I continue Cysterna once I am pregnant?", "a": "Switch to Nutriwoman Gestation once pregnancy is confirmed, and check with your doctor about any supplement during pregnancy."}, {"q": "Does it replace medical treatment?", "a": "No. It is a nutritional supplement and does not treat or cure any condition."}, {"q": "How many tablets are in a pack?", "a": "30 tablets, a one-month supply at one tablet a day."}], "safetyInfo": "• Food supplement, not a substitute for a varied diet and a healthy lifestyle.\n• Consult a healthcare professional before use if pregnant, nursing, taking medication or under medical supervision.\n• Do not exceed the recommended dose.\n• Keep out of reach of children.\n• Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.\n• If you are undergoing fertility treatment or have a diagnosed hormonal condition, use only under medical supervision."}$c$::jsonb)
