values ('5e0c1f2a-0d4b-4c8e-9a1f-1d1c0a000005',$c$Ferrovix Fort$c$,$c$CA-FFX-30$c$,$c$Women’s Health$c$,$c$Haematinic capsules with iron and folic acid for healthy blood, energy and vitality.$c$,599,null,20,$c$/products/ferrovix-fort.jpg$c$,'50% 50%',true,$c$Ferrovix Fort is a complete haematinic support formula: iron and folic acid with vitamin B12, the nutrients for the formation of haemoglobin and red blood cells, in an improved capsule formula.
It is scientifically formulated to help maintain energy release and vitality, support healthy blood and support the higher iron and folate needs of pregnancy.

Uses
Energy Release
Supports natural daily energy production and helps reduce tiredness.
Blood Formation
Supports healthy red blood cell and normal haemoglobin formation.
Iron Support
Helps maintain healthy iron levels, especially for women of reproductive age.
Pregnancy Support
Supports the increased iron and folate requirements during pregnancy.
Nervous System
Vitamin B12 supports normal nerve function.
Immunity
Supports healthy immune function.

Complete care, stronger you
Iron is the nutrient women most commonly run short of. Ferrovix Fort pairs it with the folic acid and B12 that red blood cells also need, so the body has the full kit rather than iron on its own.$c$,$c$Iron • Energy • Red blood cells • Pregnancy support$c$,$c$Nutriwoman Gestation • Cysterna$c$,$c$AM: Ferrovix Fort • PM: Nutriwoman Gestation$c$,ARRAY[$c$Improved formula$c$,$c$30 capsules$c$,$c$Halal certified$c$,$c$GMP facility$c$]::text[],$c${"benefits": [{"icon": "energy", "title": "Energy Release", "text": "Supports natural daily energy production."}, {"icon": "general", "title": "Blood Formation", "text": "Supports healthy red blood cell formation."}, {"icon": "general", "title": "Iron Support", "text": "Helps maintain healthy iron levels."}, {"icon": "heart", "title": "Haemoglobin Support", "text": "Supports normal haemoglobin formation."}, {"icon": "immunity", "title": "Immunity Support", "text": "Supports healthy immune function."}, {"icon": "focus", "title": "Nervous System Support", "text": "Vitamin B12 supports normal nerve function."}], "ingredients": [{"name": "Iron", "amount": "", "purpose": "Contributes to normal formation of red blood cells and haemoglobin, oxygen transport and the reduction of tiredness and fatigue."}, {"name": "Folic Acid", "amount": "", "purpose": "Contributes to normal blood formation and maternal tissue growth during pregnancy."}, {"name": "Vitamin B12", "amount": "", "purpose": "Contributes to normal red blood cell formation, normal nerve function and normal energy metabolism."}], "howToUse": ["Take one capsule daily after a meal, or as directed by a healthcare professional.", "Take with a source of vitamin C, and away from tea, coffee, milk and calcium supplements, for better iron absorption.", "Stools may darken while taking iron; this is normal."], "faqs": [{"q": "Who is Ferrovix Fort for?", "a": "Adults who want to support healthy iron levels and energy, particularly women of reproductive age and during pregnancy under medical advice."}, {"q": "Can I take it with Nutriwoman Gestation?", "a": "Both contain iron. Ask your doctor before combining iron products so your total intake stays appropriate."}, {"q": "Should I take it with food?", "a": "Yes, after a meal, to reduce the chance of stomach upset."}, {"q": "How many capsules are in a pack?", "a": "30 capsules, a one-month supply at one capsule a day."}], "safetyInfo": "• Food supplement, not a substitute for a varied diet and a healthy lifestyle.\n• Consult a healthcare professional before use if pregnant, nursing, taking medication or under medical supervision.\n• Do not exceed the recommended dose.\n• Keep out of reach of children.\n• Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.\n• Contains iron. Keep out of reach of children; accidental overdose of iron-containing products is a leading cause of poisoning in children under six.\n• If you have a diagnosed iron disorder such as haemochromatosis, do not use without medical advice."}$c$::jsonb)
