values ('5e0c1f2a-0d4b-4c8e-9a1f-1d1c0a000006',$c$Glutathione Capsules$c$,$c$CA-GLU-60$c$,$c$Hair & Skin$c$,$c$Advanced antioxidant and skin brightening support with glutathione.$c$,1299,null,20,$c$/products/glutathione-capsules.jpg$c$,'50% 50%',true,$c$Core Atoms Glutathione Capsules deliver glutathione, the body's principal antioxidant, for advanced antioxidant and skin brightening support.
Glutathione is made in every cell and is used up defending them against oxidative stress from sun, pollution and everyday metabolism. Supplementing helps support radiant skin, helps protect cells, and supports the liver's natural detoxification pathways, which is why it is often taken for a more even skin tone.

Uses
Radiant Skin
Supports a brighter, more even-looking skin tone over time.
Antioxidant Protection
Helps protect cells from oxidative stress.
Detox Support
Supports the liver's own detoxification pathways.

Patience pays
Skin renews itself roughly every four to six weeks, so glutathione is judged over months of daily use, not days. Pairing it with vitamin C and sun protection makes the difference visible sooner.$c$,$c$Radiant skin • Antioxidant protection • Detox support$c$,$c$Marine Collagen Powder • Hair, Skin & Nails Tablets$c$,$c$AM: Glutathione • PM: Marine Collagen$c$,ARRAY[$c$Advanced antioxidant$c$,$c$60 capsules$c$,$c$Dietary supplement$c$]::text[],$c${"benefits": [{"icon": "skin", "title": "Supports Radiant Skin", "text": "Helps support a brighter, more even skin tone with consistent daily use."}, {"icon": "immunity", "title": "Antioxidant Protection", "text": "Helps protect cells from everyday oxidative stress."}, {"icon": "digestion", "title": "Detox Support", "text": "Supports the liver's natural detoxification pathways."}, {"icon": "general", "title": "Even Skin Tone", "text": "Promotes an even complexion as part of a skincare routine."}], "ingredients": [{"name": "L-Glutathione", "amount": "", "purpose": "The body's master antioxidant: a tripeptide of glutamine, cysteine and glycine that protects cells from oxidative stress and supports detoxification. Amount as printed on the pack."}], "howToUse": ["Take one capsule daily on an empty stomach with water, or as directed by a healthcare professional.", "Pair with a vitamin C source, which helps the body recycle glutathione.", "Use daily for at least eight to twelve weeks before judging results on skin."], "faqs": [{"q": "Is glutathione a skin whitening product?", "a": "No. It supports antioxidant defence and a more even skin tone; it does not change your natural skin colour."}, {"q": "Can men take it?", "a": "Yes. Antioxidant and skin support is the same for everyone."}, {"q": "Can I take it with collagen?", "a": "Yes. Glutathione in the morning and Marine Collagen in the evening is a common stack."}, {"q": "How many capsules are in a pack?", "a": "60 capsules, a two-month supply at one capsule a day."}], "safetyInfo": "• Food supplement, not a substitute for a varied diet and a healthy lifestyle.\n• Consult a healthcare professional before use if pregnant, nursing, taking medication or under medical supervision.\n• Do not exceed the recommended dose.\n• Keep out of reach of children.\n• Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight."}$c$::jsonb)
