values ('5e0c1f2a-0d4b-4c8e-9a1f-1d1c0a000007',$c$Hair, Skin & Nails Tablets$c$,$c$CA-HSN-60$c$,$c$Hair & Skin$c$,$c$Nourish, strengthen and glow from within with biotin, collagen, keratin, vitamins and antioxidants.$c$,799,null,20,$c$/products/hair-skin-nails.jpg$c$,'50% 50%',true,$c$Core Atoms Hair, Skin & Nails Tablets nourish, strengthen and support a healthy glow from within. The formula combines biotin, collagen and keratin with vitamins, minerals, antioxidants and herbal extracts, the nutrients hair, skin and nails are built from and protected by.
Biotin contributes to the maintenance of normal hair and skin. Collagen and keratin supply the structural proteins of skin, hair and nails. Antioxidants help protect skin cells from oxidative stress.

Uses
Stronger Hair
Supports hair strength and the maintenance of normal hair.
Glowing Skin
Supports hydrated, healthy-looking skin.
Stronger Nails
Supports nail strength and helps reduce brittleness.

Built from the inside
Topical products work on the surface; hair and nails are formed below it. Supplying the building blocks daily is how the new growth improves, which is why results show over two to three months rather than overnight.$c$,$c$Stronger hair • Glowing skin • Stronger nails$c$,$c$Marine Collagen Powder • Multivitamin Women$c$,$c$AM: Multivitamin Women • PM: Hair, Skin & Nails$c$,ARRAY[$c$Biotin + collagen + keratin$c$,$c$60 tablets$c$,$c$Dietary supplement$c$]::text[],$c${"benefits": [{"icon": "skin", "title": "Stronger Hair", "text": "Biotin and keratin support the maintenance of normal, stronger hair."}, {"icon": "skin", "title": "Glowing Skin", "text": "Collagen, vitamins and antioxidants support healthy-looking, hydrated skin."}, {"icon": "general", "title": "Stronger Nails", "text": "Supports nail strength and helps reduce brittleness."}, {"icon": "immunity", "title": "Antioxidant Defence", "text": "Helps protect skin cells from everyday oxidative stress."}], "ingredients": [{"name": "Biotin", "amount": "", "purpose": "A B vitamin that contributes to the maintenance of normal hair and skin."}, {"name": "Collagen", "amount": "", "purpose": "The structural protein of skin, hair and nails, supplied as hydrolysed peptides."}, {"name": "Keratin", "amount": "", "purpose": "The protein hair and nails are made of; supports strength and resilience."}, {"name": "Vitamins and Minerals", "amount": "", "purpose": "Zinc, vitamin C and other cofactors involved in collagen formation and skin maintenance. Amounts as printed on the pack."}, {"name": "Antioxidants and Herbal Extracts", "amount": "", "purpose": "Help protect skin cells from oxidative stress and support a healthy glow."}], "howToUse": ["Take one tablet daily with a meal, or as directed by a healthcare professional.", "Use daily for at least twelve weeks; new hair and nail growth takes time to show.", "Pair with Marine Collagen Powder for additional skin support."], "faqs": [{"q": "How soon will I see results?", "a": "Nails and skin usually respond within eight weeks; hair, which grows about a centimetre a month, takes three months or more."}, {"q": "Can I take it with a multivitamin?", "a": "Yes, but check the biotin and zinc totals across products and keep within the recommended amounts."}, {"q": "Is it suitable for men?", "a": "Yes. Hair, skin and nail nutrition is the same for everyone."}, {"q": "How many tablets are in a pack?", "a": "60 tablets, a two-month supply at one tablet a day."}], "safetyInfo": "• Food supplement, not a substitute for a varied diet and a healthy lifestyle.\n• Consult a healthcare professional before use if pregnant, nursing, taking medication or under medical supervision.\n• Do not exceed the recommended dose.\n• Keep out of reach of children.\n• Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.\n• High-dose biotin can interfere with some laboratory blood tests; tell your doctor you are taking it before any test."}$c$::jsonb)
