values ('5e0c1f2a-0d4b-4c8e-9a1f-1d1c0a000008',$c$Liver Care Tablets$c$,$c$CA-LIV-60$c$,$c$Liver Health$c$,$c$Milk thistle extract with antioxidants and herbal blends for liver detox, repair and overall wellness.$c$,799,null,20,$c$/products/liver-care.jpg$c$,'50% 50%',true,$c$Core Atoms Liver Care Tablets combine milk thistle extract with antioxidants and herbal blends traditionally used to support the liver's own detoxification and repair processes.
The liver filters everything we eat, drink and breathe. Milk thistle (silymarin) has a long history of use for liver support, and the antioxidants in the formula help protect liver cells from the oxidative stress that a modern diet, alcohol and pollution create.

Uses
Liver Detox
Supports the liver's natural detoxification pathways.
Liver Repair
Helps support the maintenance and renewal of healthy liver cells.
Overall Wellness
Supports digestion, energy and everyday wellbeing.

Support, not a cure
Liver Care is a supplement for everyday liver support. It does not treat liver disease, and anyone with a diagnosed liver condition or on regular medication should use it only under medical supervision.$c$,$c$Liver detox • Liver repair • Overall wellness$c$,$c$Glutathione Capsules • Nutrifort Energy$c$,$c$AM: Nutrifort Energy • PM: Liver Care$c$,ARRAY[$c$Milk thistle extract$c$,$c$60 tablets$c$,$c$Dietary supplement$c$]::text[],$c${"benefits": [{"icon": "digestion", "title": "Liver Detox", "text": "Supports the liver's natural detoxification pathways."}, {"icon": "general", "title": "Liver Repair", "text": "Helps support the maintenance and renewal of healthy liver cells."}, {"icon": "immunity", "title": "Antioxidant Protection", "text": "Antioxidants help protect liver cells from oxidative stress."}, {"icon": "energy", "title": "Overall Wellness", "text": "Supports digestion, energy and everyday wellbeing."}], "ingredients": [{"name": "Milk Thistle Extract (Silybum marianum)", "amount": "", "purpose": "Standardised for silymarin, the flavonoid complex traditionally used to support liver function and protect liver cells."}, {"name": "Antioxidants", "amount": "", "purpose": "Help protect liver cells from oxidative stress."}, {"name": "Herbal Blend", "amount": "", "purpose": "Traditionally used herbs that support digestion and liver wellness. See the pack for the full list."}], "howToUse": ["Take one tablet daily after a meal, or as directed by a healthcare professional.", "Use for at least eight weeks for meaningful support; the liver renews itself gradually.", "Combine with limited alcohol, plenty of water and a balanced diet."], "faqs": [{"q": "Can I take Liver Care if I drink socially?", "a": "Yes, as everyday liver support, but it is not a licence to drink more; moderation matters more than any supplement."}, {"q": "Can I take it with medication?", "a": "Milk thistle can interact with some medicines. Ask your doctor or pharmacist first."}, {"q": "Is it suitable for men and women?", "a": "Yes."}, {"q": "How many tablets are in a pack?", "a": "60 tablets, a two-month supply at one tablet a day."}], "safetyInfo": "• Food supplement, not a substitute for a varied diet and a healthy lifestyle.\n• Consult a healthcare professional before use if pregnant, nursing, taking medication or under medical supervision.\n• Do not exceed the recommended dose.\n• Keep out of reach of children.\n• Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.\n• Do not use if allergic to plants of the daisy family (Asteraceae).\n• If you have a diagnosed liver condition, use only under medical supervision."}$c$::jsonb)
